Package: openmux-install-menu
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: OpenMux <support@openmux.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/OpenMux
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: xz-utils, zstd
Description: OpenMux install medium boot menu (neutral utility)
 Plain-text install/rescue menu for the OpenMux USB install medium:
 install a target image to disk, program the internal serial number,
 set/restore the EEPROM boot order, run board tests, drop to a shell,
 reboot/power off, and toggle the stick's overlay root filesystem.
 The menu is a neutral utility only; autologin, the root shell profile
 and any other factory boot behaviour are not part of this package -
 they are applied by the openmux-install-medium layer at build time.
